# @wolffm/* lives on GitHub Packages, not npmjs. Same line as every other
# hadoku repo (aggregator, task, contact-ui, jobplatform, resume-bot).
#
# The auth token is deliberately NOT here. Locally it comes from ~/.npmrc; in
# CI, actions/setup-node (or WolffM/hadoku-actions/setup-pnpm) writes it from
# secrets.HADOKU_NPM_READ_TOKEN. GITHUB_TOKEN cannot be used: it is scoped to
# this repository and cannot read @wolffm/* tarballs, and a warm pnpm store
# hides the resulting 403 until a cold runner exposes it.
@wolffm:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
